{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"hot_spring","model_identifier":"hot_spring","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# hot_spring\n\nHot spring (Patch 5): the crust round a hot spring pool: pale yellow-orange mineral crust in rings and terraces, sulphur-capped stones and patches, a glowing bubbling vent and dead twigs. The water itself is drawn by the terrain. `fx_steam_1` to `fx_steam_3` mark where steam rises and `fx_bubble` the vent.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -44..44, y -1..17, z -32..36 units. Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 256 x 128, 1 px per unit, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 54 (full 54).\n\n## State group sets\n\n- `full` only (it is never used up)."},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"sand_crust_b1#d8b860","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-36,0,10],"to":[-20,4.2,24],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[212,65,228,69],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[96,70,110,74],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[228,65,244,69],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[110,70,124,74],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[118,20,134,34],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[134,20,150,34],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"02008e11-45f1-cbfb-486d-7c6204d1a700"},{"name":"sand_crust_b2#cfae58","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-24,-0.3,16],"to":[-4,5.4,32],"autouv":0,"color":7,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[98,46,118,52],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,53,16,59],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[118,46,138,52],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[16,53,32,59],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[148,0,168,16],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[168,0,188,16],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"159f8518-1a63-9997-0b97-f442e837d6ba"},{